  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The spacetime diagram shows the reference frame in which three warning lights, A, B, and C, are at rest. The warning lights flash in sequence. The world line of a spacecraft is also shown.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the order in which the three warning lights flash as observed by a person on the spacecraft?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">A, B, C</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">B, A, C</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">C, B, A</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">B, C, A</li>\n</ol>"
